# Static sketch server (npm start) uses port 3301 via package.json

# OSC bridge (npm run osc:bridge) — TouchDesigner UDP → WebSocket
#
# TouchDesigner OSC Out — recommended local unicast:
#   Protocol: Messaging (UDP)
#   Network Address: 127.0.0.1
#   Network Port: 1337
#   Local Address: your machine LAN IP (same as OSC_LOCAL_ADDRESS below)
#   Local Port: leave empty / auto — do not use 1337
#
# Multicast alternative:
#   Protocol: Multi-Cast Messaging (UDP)
#   Network Address: 239.255.0.1
#   Network Port: 1337
#
# Test without TD: npm run osc:test (with bridge running)
OSC_PORTS=1337,1338
OSC_MULTICAST=239.255.0.1
OSC_LOCAL_ADDRESS=127.0.0.1
OSC_WS_PORT=3302
OSC_HOST=0.0.0.0
